## Licence

Upstream states two different licences and neither statement is complete:

- the repository's `LICENSE` file is the **CERN Open Hardware Licence
  Version 2 - Strongly Reciprocal**, and the top-level `README.md` badge and
  licensing section both name CERN-OHL-S v2;
- `PAR6 Description/readme.md` says "This model is released under an
  [Apache-2.0 License](LICENSE)" — but that link has no target: there is no
  `LICENSE` file in that directory.

par6 does not resolve the ambiguity. Anyone redistributing these files should
check with Source Robotics; CERN-OHL-S v2 is the stricter reading and the one
backed by an actual licence text.

